  "details": "you can no longer \"tag\" players from the main menu. this method to show users bubbles (hitboxes) was very useful to see if someone was using psm or a hacked client to fly, noclip, speed, jump, teleport etc, which was essential for valid clientusage reports. please re-add the possibility to select users from the old main menu and also from the new one ofc when the old one fully goes. \nthe cursor still interacts with the selection bubble like before, but it will not highlight the player anymore on a click.\nplease re-add the old behaviour or a proper replacement,\nthanks",
